 the <strong>Side Deck</strong>: a strategic tool that lets you adjust your deck when needed, instead of being entirely dependent on random card rewards like in other games. It puts <strong>control back in your hands</strong> and rewards smart adaptation. But can you survive the <strong>Darkest Cube?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650350/extras/309c4699d869fae7f8e85481effaab14.avif?t=1770890325\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Co-op Mode on the Horizon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We believe there are too few good co-op experiences \u2014 games that truly connect and challenge friends together. In the niche of roguelike deck-builders (only around 800 titles exist), almost none explore <strong>cooperative gameplay</strong>. We want to change that. Team up with friends, face even greater challenges, and discover new <strong>synergies between decks</strong> across over <strong>60 cards per class</strong> \u2014 with <strong>five unique classes</strong> planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650350/extras/262d1d4571e393b0554dfcfe9338fdaf.avif?t=1770890325\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. A Draft Mode Worth Waiting For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We\u2019re keeping this one secret... for now. Let\u2019s just say: it will surprise you.</p>","developers":["PEC Game Design"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650350/30170dc647eb57a6d1de423fad4af8ef4fc5b677/header.jpg?t=1770890325","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 PEC Game Design GmbH. All rights reserved.","linux_